{
    "title": "Twerk Race 3d \u2014 Fun run game!",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfae Welcome to Twerk Race 3D\u2014the wildest running game with exciting racing tasks! \ud83c\udfc1 Get ready to dash across the track, shake your body in a twerk battle, and chomp your way through some fun racing challenges in the world of exciting run 3d games! Ready, set, go! \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83c\udfae\r\n\r\nIn this racing game, you'll be zooming across tracks, gobbling up snacks faster than a hungry cheetah. But here's the twist of this racing challenge: healthy food makes you slim, while a burger or a sandwich beef you up! \ud83c\udf54\ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f The bigger your bod, the better your chances of victory in our run race 3d simulator! \ud83d\udcaa\r\n\r\nThe real fun begins at the end of each level of this racing game with the ultimate showdown: the twerking battle! \ud83d\udc83 Show off your moves and get to the top of the leaderboard in this Twerk Race 3d \u2014 fun run game! \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udd7a\r\n\r\nRace Faster Than Lightning\r\nSprint and eat every burger or sandwich like a crazy diner to build a perfect body in this fun race game! Complete every crazy rush with the biggest body imaginable to win the twerk battle and become the ultimate racing twerk master! Watch out, though: collecting every burger won\u2019t be enough\u2014think about your winning strategy, or you\u2019ll have to restart running! \ud83c\udfc6\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\r\n\r\nRun Race 3D with Obstacles\r\nOur race game is packed with crazy obstacles: fragile glass platforms, barriers, slides, and more to mess up your progress, so you\u2019ll have to restart running. Sometimes your runner must lose body weight and muscles to pass an obstacle in a rush. So skip a sandwich and get healthy food to make your body run faster! \ud83e\udd57\ud83d\udc83\r\n\r\nEpic Twerking Battle\r\nThis isn't just your average run race 3d running game! There\u2019s a twerking battle waiting for you when you finish. After all, it\u2019s also a twerk simulator! At the end of each crazy rush, you\u2019ll find an exciting battle that will put your twerking skills to the test. Save all your strength to clash with your opponent in the ring and become the twerk hero in this dancing race! \ud83c\udf1f\ud83d\udc83\r\n\r\nTwerk Simulator with a Twist\r\nAfter the dancing race, you can also open your own business: an incredible gym! Make your body run like crazy during the 3d racing to get more money and buy new equipment for it. Establish your own gym to help others grow their muscles or keep their body fit and healthy! \ud83e\udd57\ud83d\udcaa\r\n\r\nReady to prove you\u2019re the real twerk master? Then start collecting food, don\u2019t clash with other runners on the tracks, and pass every obstacle on your heels, racer!\r\n\r\nBest Features of Twerk Race 3d \u2013 fun run game:\r\n\ud83c\udfae Simple run 3d games mechanics: Move your character like in any runner to get to the twerk battle at the end and become the twerk hero!\r\n\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Diverse runners: unlike in other racing games, you can choose not only a fun outfit or cute heels to rush through the track but also the gender of your racer in our twerking simulator!\r\n\ud83c\udf89 Dynamic 3d racing: Become a crazy diner to change your body and tackle every hurdle while completing your running track games!\r\n\ud83d\udcaa Your own business: Take a break from your twerking games to open your gym and help others build their muscles in this fun burger game!\r\n\ud83d\udc83 Exciting final battle: Make your character big and strong to crush your opponent with your thick muscles at the final battle of this twerking simulator!\r\n\r\nForget about other running track games or twerking games! Twerk Race 3d will become your fave, with its fun races, cute characters, and awesome graphics! Racing games have never been this exciting! \ud83c\udf89\ud83d\udd7a\r\n\r\nDownload our burger game now to revel in an endlessly entertaining runner that\u2019s guaranteed to dispel your boredom and get you dancing all day! \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udc83",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udfae Welcome to Twerk Race 3D\u2014the wildest running game with exciting racing tasks! \ud83c\udfc1 Get ready to dash across the track, shake your body in a twerk battle, and chomp your way through some fun racing challenges in the world of exciting run 3d games! Ready, set, go! \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83c\udfae<br><br>In this racing game, you&#39;ll be zooming across tracks, gobbling up snacks faster than a hungry cheetah. But here&#39;s the twist of this racing challenge: healthy food makes you slim, while a burger or a sandwich beef you up! \ud83c\udf54\ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f The bigger your bod, the better your chances of victory in our run race 3d simulator! \ud83d\udcaa<br><br>The real fun begins at the end of each level of this racing game with the ultimate showdown: the twerking battle! \ud83d\udc83 Show off your moves and get to the top of the leaderboard in this Twerk Race 3d \u2014 fun run game! \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udd7a<br><br>Race Faster Than Lightning<br>Sprint and eat every burger or sandwich like a crazy diner to build a perfect body in this fun race game! Complete every crazy rush with the biggest body imaginable to win the twerk battle and become the ultimate racing twerk master! Watch out, though: collecting every burger won\u2019t be enough\u2014think about your winning strategy, or you\u2019ll have to restart running! \ud83c\udfc6\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f<br><br>Run Race 3D with Obstacles<br>Our race game is packed with crazy obstacles: fragile glass platforms, barriers, slides, and more to mess up your progress, so you\u2019ll have to restart running. Sometimes your runner must lose body weight and muscles to pass an obstacle in a rush. So skip a sandwich and get healthy food to make your body run faster! \ud83e\udd57\ud83d\udc83<br><br>Epic Twerking Battle<br>This isn&#39;t just your average run race 3d running game! There\u2019s a twerking battle waiting for you when you finish. After all, it\u2019s also a twerk simulator! At the end of each crazy rush, you\u2019ll find an exciting battle that will put your twerking skills to the test. Save all your strength to clash with your opponent in the ring and become the twerk hero in this dancing race! \ud83c\udf1f\ud83d\udc83<br><br>Twerk Simulator with a Twist<br>After the dancing race, you can also open your own business: an incredible gym! Make your body run like crazy during the 3d racing to get more money and buy new equipment for it. Establish your own gym to help others grow their muscles or keep their body fit and healthy! \ud83e\udd57\ud83d\udcaa<br><br>Ready to prove you\u2019re the real twerk master? Then start collecting food, don\u2019t clash with other runners on the tracks, and pass every obstacle on your heels, racer!<br><br>Best Features of Twerk Race 3d \u2013 fun run game:<br>\ud83c\udfae Simple run 3d games mechanics: Move your character like in any runner to get to the twerk battle at the end and become the twerk hero!<br>\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Diverse runners: unlike in other racing games, you can choose not only a fun outfit or cute heels to rush through the track but also the gender of your racer in our twerking simulator!<br>\ud83c\udf89 Dynamic 3d racing: Become a crazy diner to change your body and tackle every hurdle while completing your running track games!<br>\ud83d\udcaa Your own business: Take a break from your twerking games to open your gym and help others build their muscles in this fun burger game!<br>\ud83d\udc83 Exciting final battle: Make your character big and strong to crush your opponent with your thick muscles at the final battle of this twerking simulator!<br><br>Forget about other running track games or twerking games! Twerk Race 3d will become your fave, with its fun races, cute characters, and awesome graphics! Racing games have never been this exciting! \ud83c\udf89\ud83d\udd7a<br><br>Download our burger game now to revel in an endlessly entertaining runner that\u2019s guaranteed to dispel your boredom and get you dancing all day! \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udc83",
